
[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
QA Phase 3.1b — KINWAVE functional storage + seepage.
Exercises the Routing.cpp getVolume/getDepth (Router::step) and
getSurfArea (initNodeFlows, via seepage) side-table read sites.

